The '''Southern Marshlands'''<ref name="Battles">''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''</ref> was a location on the [[planet]] [[Mimban]]. During the [[Mimban Campaign]] in [[10 BBY]], [[Lieutenant]] [[Alayus Bolandin]] briefed members of the [[224th Imperial Armored Division]] that in three [[Standard hour|hours]] they would move out for the southern marshlands, and as such, wanted an advance party of ten men.<ref name="Solo" />

